# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local

# Local environment files — real Cognito pool ids and backend hosts must never
# be committed. `.env.example` (template) and `.env.production` (mock flag only,
# no secrets) are deliberately tracked and are not matched by these patterns.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Product specs (.docx / extracted .md) are shared through Confluence, not the
# repo — they are large binaries and are revised outside this codebase.
specs/

# .claude/ is committed (project skills + CLAUDE.md travel with the repo).
# Only machine-specific local settings are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
